# Project Structure

core/                     ← pure Python, no Textual
  models.py               TierList, Tier, Entry dataclasses
  storage.py              load/save JSON
  aggregate.py            weighted average + outlier detection
  cli.py                  `python -m core.cli` prints the final board

tui/                      ← screens only, calls into core
  app.py                  App + SCREENS registry
  screens/
    menu.py               main menu
    new_list.py           ModalScreen: name, tiers, PAR, importance
    editor.py             the tier board (your existing demo, made reusable)
    results.py            final board + outlier table